# state: first-run   (recorded on a disk with no save for the title (NOTES.md E); lane.savestate433)
# Capcom Classics Collection Vol. 2 (43430019), Thor. DRAFT by
# lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not played. NO FRAMES ON DISK for this title:
# every step is [guess].
#
# The collection emulates arcade boards. The route picks the first game in
# the list, inserts a coin and starts it. In this collection BACK is the
# arcade coin and START is the arcade start [guess, recalled]. One file: an
# autosave prompt at boot, if any, is accepted with A and does not change
# the path afterwards.
#
# Adopted by lane.titleroutes 2026-09-30 (session 42) unchanged in its steps
# except where noted, and queued as a Thor screening soak (<= 480 s, the
# fan-dead Thor's cold-slot runner): NOT YET REPLAYED. Every step leaves a
# frame, so a soak that misses gameplay is the survey that revises it.
wait 30
shot boot30
press START                 # [guess] skip logos
wait 15
shot boot45
press START                 # [guess] title prompt
wait 8
shot after-title            # OPEN: an autosave / storage prompt, or the game list
press A
wait 8
shot game-list              # [guess] the first game highlighted
mark booted
press A                     # [guess] choose the game
wait 6
shot game-menu              # [guess] "Play Game" highlighted
press A
wait 20
shot arcade-boot            # the emulated board's boot / attract
press BACK                  # [guess] coin
wait 2
shot coin
press START                 # [guess] 1P start
wait 6
shot started
press A
wait 6
shot started-a
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with the player's ship/fighter under control
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    press A
    wait 0.5
    press X
    wait 0.5
    axis LX min
    press A
    wait 0.5
    press X
    wait 0.5
    axis LX mid
    axis LY min
    press A
    wait 0.5
    axis LY mid
    press BACK              # a coin now and then continues after a game over
    wait 0.3
    press START
    wait 0.5
}
